A1. Little shots. ~ SIPS
A5. This is always hanging 'round the cowboy's neck. ~ BANDANA
A11. A new one is hard to get. ~ IDEA
A12. A big fuss is made over this. ~ ADO
A13. This doesn't last a minute. ~ SECOND
A17. This'll take you for a ride. ~ CARFARE
A19. More inclined. ~ STEEPER
A20. Something that doesn't stay open all night. ~ EYE
