A28. Beautiful like Bull Montana. ~ UGLY
A29. All washed-up like a wet collar. ~ LIMP
A30. This goes off and makes the morning hideous. ~ ALARM
A31. She with the four-quart capacity. ~ GAL
A32. Sparking place. ~ LANE
A33. What a man's arm does around a woman's waist. ~ FITS
A34. A great little result-getter. ~ AD
A35. The price he had to pay. ~ COST
A36. A heavenly bonnet. ~ HALO
