A61. You'll always find this in a whirl. ~ EDDY

D1. We hope you wouldn't be mean enough to say this to a dog. ~ SIC
D2. This is a Mount. ~ IDA
D3. A catty for. ~ PER
D4. How the Babe arrived home after a hard bat. ~ SAFELY
D5. Fully clothed like an Earl Carroll girl. ~ BARE
D6. There's no kick to this. ~ ADE
